cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Nirun
abstract: >-
  A health management system for healthcare providers, built on Odoo with
  clinical data modeled after the HL7 FHIR standard and Thai localization
  (ICD-10-TM, ICD-9-CM, NHSO, Buddhist calendar). Notably deployed for
  elderly care in Thailand: in production use since 2023 at 12 social
  welfare development centers for the elderly under Thailand's Department
  of Older Persons, and since 2025 expanded to support 800+ community
  social caregivers providing elderly care nationwide.
